{"id":"5deae0a21cc8b810","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-generated-filter.md","title":"Generated Filter and Finite Intersection Property","display":"df-generated-filter — Generated Filter and Finite Intersection Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-generated-filter","aliases":["17-df-generated-filter"],"display":"df-generated-filter — Generated Filter and Finite Intersection Property","depends_on":["[[17-df-filter]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"generated filter and finite intersection property definitions","source_pages_print":[212],"source_pages_djvu":[228],"source_verification":"statement-compared; explicit finite-family formulation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-generated-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-generated-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generated-filter — Generated Filter and Finite Intersection Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"generated filter and finite intersection property definitions"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>212</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>228</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; explicit finite-family formulation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span> 为集合族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Filter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Filter}_I\\)</span> 采用允许非真滤子的原书约定，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 为候选子族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{card}\">\\(\\operatorname{card}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> 及基数次序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>。以下定义有限交性质谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FIP}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{FIP}_I\\)</span> 与生成滤子函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I:\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))\">\\(\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I:\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FIP}_I(E)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall e\\subseteq E\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{card}(e)&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\exists i\\in I\\;\\forall X\\in e\\;(i\\in X)\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I(E)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I)):\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\land E\\subseteq F\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FIP}_I(E)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall e\\subseteq E\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{card}(e)&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\exists i\\in I\\;\\forall X\\in e\\;(i\\in X)\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I(E)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I)):\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\land E\\subseteq F\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷 p.212（DjVu 228），命题4.1.1之前的两个定义。生成滤子的交集族非空，因为允许非真滤子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span>，故不存在空交的歧义。有限交性质用一个共同元素表达，包含空有限子族；该情形由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(I\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span> 保证。创建前已搜索本册原子、术语表的 GeneratedFilter、FIP、finite intersection、生成滤子和有限交性质，未找到兼容定义；既有对角嵌入已存在，因而未重复创建。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 为非空集合，$E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$ 为集合族。$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$ 采用允许非真滤子的原书约定，见 [[17-df-filter]]。$e$ 为候选子族；$\\operatorname{card}$、$\\aleph_0$ 及基数次序见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]。以下定义有限交性质谓词 $\\operatorname{FIP}_I$ 与生成滤子函数 $\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I:\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 为非空集合，$E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$ 为集合族。$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$ 采用允许非真滤子的原书约定，见 [[17-df-filter]]。$e$ 为候选子族；$\\operatorname{card}$、$\\aleph_0$ 及基数次序见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]。以下定义有限交性质谓词 $\\operatorname{FIP}_I$ 与生成滤子函数 $\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I:\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Filter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{card}","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FIP}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I:\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FIP}_I(E)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall e\\subseteq E\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{card}(e)<\\aleph_0\\to\\exists i\\in I\\;\\forall X\\in e\\;(i\\in X)\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I(E)&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I)):\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\land E\\subseteq F\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\neq\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1933,"backlinks":[{"id":"fce963a0c22b921d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$I$ 是非空集合，$E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$，$D=\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I(E)$，见 [[17-df-generated-filter]]。$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$、$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]；$\\operatorname{FIP}_I$ 见 [[17-df-generated-filter]]。"},{"id":"421b1aea26ad8bcb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-generated-filter]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactnes